OL,3,GNEWSAActress Phyllida Law, mother of
OL,4,AEmma and Sophie Thompson, dies at 94
OL,5,
OL,6,FStage and screen star Phyllida Law, the
OL,7,Fmother of fellow actresses Dame Emma
OL,8,Fand Sophie Thompson, has died at the
OL,9,Fage of 94.
OL,11,F"It is with great sadness we have to
OL,12,Fannounce that Phyllida Law died
OL,13,Fsupremely peacefully at home,
OL,14,Fsurrounded by all of her family, on
OL,15,FMonday 27th July," her manager Jacky
OL,16,FLeggo said in a statement to BBC News.
OL,18,F"We had worked together for over fifty
OL,19,Fyears and she was a beautiful person
OL,20,Finside and out."
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
