OL,3,GNEWSAActress Phyllida Law, mother of
OL,4,AEmma and Sophie Thompson, dies at 94
OL,5,
OL,6,FLaw appeared on screen alongside her
OL,7,Fdaughters several times throughout a
OL,8,Flong and varied career, including in
OL,9,Fthe 1996 adaptation of Jane Austen's
OL,10,FEmma, starring Gwyneth Paltrow. Law
OL,11,Fplayed Mrs Bates while Sophie played
OL,12,Fher daughter Miss Bates.
